# Mom, the Adventurer? (bastok 21): the letter's other sides. Completed by GM with the mustZone clear and the letter by
# GM (never seen): Nbu's 233 (200 gil, completed again, the mustZone set). Then accepted again by GM (delQuest, then
# addQuest: addQuest alone leaves the completed bit, and the completed status wins) with a new letter that is then
# seen: Nbu's 234 (100 gil, completed). A letter given again after a seen one stays seen (the seen bit outlives
# delKeyItem), so the unseen side comes first.
lists BastokMarkets/Nbu_Latteh/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/233 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/234
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-114.8,-4,-112.3 lvl=10
quest Bastok.MomTheAdventurer completed
keyitem LetterFromRohLatteh
login
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # completed, mustZone clear, the letter not seen: 233
finish                         # completed again: fame +10, the letter deleted, 200 gil, the mustZone set
quest Bastok.MomTheAdventurer available
quest Bastok.MomTheAdventurer accepted
keyitem LetterFromRohLatteh
seekeyitem LetterFromRohLatteh
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # accepted, the letter seen: 234
finish                         # completed, 100 gil
